        G('e11g3', 'Reveal the explanation for the confusing situation', [N('Resulta que', 'Resulta que introduces the information that explains the misunderstanding. The present form is natural in conversational storytelling even though the revealed situation, era para el vecino, is past.')], ['Resulta que', 'Por ejemplo,', 'A continuación,'], [W('Por ejemplo,', 'Por ejemplo introduces an illustration of a general idea. This sentence reveals the missing explanation for this particular mistake.'), W('A continuación,', 'A continuación signals the next step in a sequence. Here era explains an existing situation rather than adding the next action.')])
